        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s layout was designed in 1907 by Wilbur David Cook and George E. Kessler, who also planned Fair Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
