      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Twenty percent of the original land was reserved for parks, giving Highland Park its lush green streets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highland_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Highland Park Public Library, opened in 1930, sits right next to the town hall and was renovated in 2008.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
